# Recipe: Command Palette

Coming soon — this recipe walks a VS Code-style command palette:
global keyboard accelerator, fuzzy-search filtering, command execution
via the Reactor `Command` primitive. See
[the AI Author Skill](../../../_pipeline/ai-author-skill.md) for the
planned surface.

Until then, [Commanding](../commanding.md) and
[Input and Gestures](../input-and-gestures.md) cover the underlying
primitives.
